            <ArticleTitle>Managing arthritis pain amid evolving science on pain relievers.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>58-9, 49</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new look at treatment options for managing chronic arthritis pain. With the disappearance of two COX-2 drugs from the market, and new questions about traditional NSAID medications, many clinicians are wondering just how they should proceed with patients suffering from chronic arthritis pain. Two experts on the subject share their findings and recommendations.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
